WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.360
The next school sections move from mechanisms to patient assessment, medication safety, monographs, pediatric preparation, scope and integrated trauma. We will follow that whole decision chain rather than memorize six disconnected drug cards.
学校后续分节从机制走向患者评估、药物安全、专论、儿科配制、权限及综合创伤。这里跟随整个决策链，而不是背六张互不相连药卡。

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:27.456
First identify immediate threats and a meaningful treatment goal. Medication must fit within airway, breathing, circulation and transport priorities, not replace them.
先识别即时威胁及有意义治疗目标。药物要融入气道、呼吸、循环及转运优先级，不能代替这些。

00:00:27.456 --> 00:00:40.104
School narrative sometimes contains old or conflicting numbers. In this lecture, school statements are identified as school statements, and verified current service rules are identified separately.
学校正文有时出现旧数字或互相冲突数字。本讲把学校说法明确作为学校说法，把已核现行机构规则另行标明。

00:00:40.104 --> 00:00:55.728
Do not guess which contradictory number an instructor intends to assess. Learn the underlying calculation, record the discrepancy and use the confirmed school examination version for that assessment, while never treating it as automatic field authority.
不能猜老师究竟考哪个冲突数字。应学会底层计算、记录差异，并为考核使用已确认学校版本，但不能自动把它当现场权限。

00:00:55.728 --> 00:01:08.112
Before treatment, document the problem you are trying to improve and the patient's current physiological state. Include the drug-specific safety checks, not just a generic normal-vitals statement.
治疗前记录想改善的问题及当前生理状态。包括药物特定安全检查，不能只写笼统“生命体征正常”。

00:01:08.112 --> 00:01:23.520
For breathlessness, the school WHIPS questions ask about the worst episode, hospital visits, intensive care, puffer requirements and steroid use. They supplement present assessment rather than deciding stability by history alone.
气促时，学校WHIPS询问最重发作、医院就诊、重症监护、吸入药需求和激素使用。它补充当前评估，不能只凭病史决定稳定。

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:37.416
Check the allergy reaction, all recent doses and relevant prescription, nonprescription and recreational substances. Duplicate ingredients in a cold remedy can matter as much as a named prescription.
核实过敏实际反应、所有近期剂量，以及相关处方、非处方和娱乐性物质。感冒药重复成分可能和处方一样重要。

00:01:37.416 --> 00:01:49.752
Pain scores standardize a patient's report; they do not turn subjective pain into an objective laboratory result. Pair the score with function, relevant findings and the person's treatment goal.
痛评分使患者报告标准化，不会把主观痛变成客观化验。要结合功能、相关发现及本人治疗目标。

00:01:49.752 --> 00:02:02.280
Reassess the finding that justified treatment. If bronchospasm was the goal, compare air entry, effort, speech and symptoms; a new heart rate alone cannot tell you the treatment worked.
复查支持治疗的发现。若目标是支气管痉挛，就比较进气、用力、说话和症状；新心率本身不能说明药有效。

00:02:02.280 --> 00:02:14.544
Check immediate safety at the same time. After an opioid or sedating drug, observe depth and quality of breathing and airway protection, not only a displayed saturation.
同时检查即时安全。阿片或镇静药后看呼吸深度质量及气道保护，不只看显示血氧。

00:02:14.544 --> 00:02:25.488
Use the current drug-specific reassessment interval and assess sooner if the patient changes. An interval is not a reason to ignore deterioration before the next scheduled reading.
按当前具体药物间隔复评，患者变化就提前评估。规定间隔不能成为下次测量前忽视恶化的理由。

00:02:25.488 --> 00:02:39.336
Record actual time, dose, route, intended effect and observed response. A second dose is a new decision requiring the previous response, cumulative amount and contraindications to be reconsidered.
记录实际时间、剂量、途径、预期及所见反应。第二剂是新决策，须重新考虑前剂反应、累计量和禁忌。

00:02:39.336 --> 00:02:50.472
Drowsiness after medication may be a known effect, but new inability to protect the airway or inadequate ventilation is not acceptable simply because sedation was expected.
给药后困倦可能是已知作用，但新出现气道保护失败或通气不足，不能因“本来就会镇静”而接受。

00:02:50.472 --> 00:03:04.584
A sudden pressure fall can follow a vasodilator or rapid injection, but may also be ongoing bleeding or another deterioration. Support the patient and reassess cause, rather than assuming one explanation.
血压突降可发生于扩血管药或快速注射后，也可能是持续出血或其他恶化。先支持患者并重评原因，不要只认一个解释。

00:03:04.584 --> 00:03:20.088
The school contrasts a morphine-related itch with anaphylaxis. Isolated itch is different from airway, respiratory or circulatory compromise, but a suspected non-IgE mechanism cannot rule out a severe systemic reaction.
学校比较吗啡相关瘙痒和全身过敏。单独痒不同于气道、呼吸或循环受损，但怀疑非IgE机制不能排除严重全身反应。

00:03:20.088 --> 00:03:35.016
Stop a suspected triggering infusion where appropriate, reassess ABCs and use the anaphylaxis pathway when indicated. Antihistamine symptom relief must not replace epinephrine for life-threatening anaphylaxis.
适当时停止可疑触发输注，重查ABC，有适应证就走全身过敏路径。止痒抗组胺不能代替危及生命过敏所需肾上腺素。

00:03:35.016 --> 00:03:49.344
An opioid pattern highlights inadequate ventilation and reduced awareness. Cholinergic excess highlights secretions and bronchospasm. Identify the immediate physiology before trying to name the exact chemical.
阿片模式强调通气不足和意识降低，胆碱能过度强调分泌物和支气管痉挛。先识别即时生理问题，再尝试说具体化学物。

00:03:49.344 --> 00:04:02.856
Sympathomimetic and anticholinergic toxicity can both produce tachycardia, heat and altered behaviour. Sweating versus dryness can help, but is not a perfect rule and mixed exposures are possible.
拟交感及抗胆碱毒性都可导致心动过速、热和行为改变。出汗与干燥有助区分，但非完美规则，也可能混合暴露。

00:04:02.856 --> 00:04:16.968
Do not attribute every altered patient to substance use. Hypoxia, hypoglycemia, stroke, infection and injury can overlap these presentations. Measure and assess the relevant alternatives.
不能把所有意识变化都归物质使用。缺氧、低血糖、卒中、感染和损伤可与这些表现重叠，应测量并评估相关替代病因。

00:04:16.968 --> 00:04:29.904
Protect the team from exposure, request appropriate resources and provide authorized supportive care. Toxidrome recognition is an assessment tool, not unrestricted permission to give an antidote.
保护团队免暴露，请求适当资源并提供获授权支持照护。识别中毒综合征是评估工具，不是无限给解毒剂权限。

00:04:29.904 --> 00:04:42.240
If the expected effect is absent, first reconsider the assessed problem. A bronchodilator cannot fix every cause of dyspnea and an antiemetic cannot correct all causes of vomiting.
预期作用未出现时，先重新考虑所评估问题。扩张药不能纠正所有气促病因，止吐药不能纠正所有呕吐病因。

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:55.200
Check what was actually delivered. Examine the label, amount, timing, device technique and any vascular site. A calculation on paper does not prove the dose entered the patient.
查实际送入什么：标签、药量、时间、装置技术及血管部位。纸上算对不证明剂量已进患者。

00:04:55.200 --> 00:05:07.896
Consider delayed absorption, poor perfusion, interacting drugs and the expected onset or peak. Stacking additional medication before those checks can create a later overshoot.
考虑吸收延迟、灌注差、相互作用及预期起效或峰效。没核查就堆叠药物，之后可能作用过头。

00:05:07.896 --> 00:05:20.856
Maintain immediate supportive care, then decide among an authorized repeat, a different plan, consultation or escalation. Write the reason so the next clinician understands the sequence.
持续即时支持照护，再决定获授权重复、换计划、会诊或升级，并写理由，让接手者理解顺序。

00:05:20.856 --> 00:05:37.560
Eight A explicitly teaches eight rights: patient, medication, dose, route, time, reason, documentation and response. Learn that school list accurately rather than silently replacing it with a differently numbered mnemonic.
8A明确教八项正确：患者、药物、剂量、途径、时间、理由、记录及反应。要准确学该学校清单，不能暗中换成另一编号口诀。

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:51.768
BCEHS presents a six-right foundation, and other school material uses an expanded framework. The count differs because items are grouped differently; none removes consent, allergy or contraindication checks.
BCEHS给出六项基础，其他学校资料使用扩展框架。数量不同是分组方式不同，任何一版都不取消同意、过敏或禁忌检查。

00:05:51.768 --> 00:06:04.536
The right patient includes identity and suitability for the indication. The right response is not something you can guarantee before giving a drug; it is an obligation to evaluate benefit and harm afterwards.
正确患者包括身份及符合适应证。正确反应不是给药前能保证的结果，而是给药后评价益处和伤害的责任。

00:06:04.536 --> 00:06:19.224
A capable patient's refusal still matters even if refusal is not numbered in this eight-item list. Clarify concerns and apply the consent and refusal process; do not treat the mnemonic as permission to override them.
有能力患者的拒绝仍重要，即使不在八项编号内。应澄清担忧并采用同意拒绝流程，不能把口诀当越过这些的权限。

00:06:19.224 --> 00:06:32.592
Inspect the actual container at selection, preparation and the final patient check. Stop for an unclear label, wrong strength, damage, expiry or an unexpected appearance.
选择、配制及最终患者检查时都看真实容器。标签不清、强度错、损坏、过期或外观异常时停下。

00:06:32.592 --> 00:06:46.608
An independent checker uses the original weight, order or monograph and product label before comparing results. Asking only whether your stated answer looks right creates an anchoring check, not a truly independent one.
独立核查者先用原体重、医嘱或专论和制剂标签，再比较答案。只问对方“我答案对吗”会造成锚定，不是真独立核查。

00:06:46.608 --> 00:07:02.112
Label a prepared syringe or infusion with the drug and final concentration. Keep clean and contaminated handling separate and do not use a prefilled saline-flush syringe as the container for medication dilution or storage.
给配好注射器或输注标药名及最终浓度，分开清洁和污染操作，不用预充盐水冲管注射器配制或储存药物。

00:07:02.112 --> 00:07:15.648
If a discrepancy is discovered, pause that medication, preserve immediate care and resolve the inputs. Urgency calls for a rehearsed safe workflow, not abandoning identity and concentration checks.
发现差异就暂停该药，维持即时照护并解决输入。紧急要求熟练安全流程，不是放弃身份和浓度核查。

00:07:15.648 --> 00:07:24.384
A useful monograph answers why to give the drug, whether this patient qualifies, how to prepare it and how to know whether it helped or harmed.
有用专论回答为何给、患者是否符合、怎样配制，以及如何知道帮助或伤害。

00:07:24.384 --> 00:07:35.232
Read the license-level and clinical-context headings before a dose. A nearby pediatric or advanced-care table is not automatically part of PCP authorization.
先读执照等级及临床情境标题，再读剂量。旁边儿科或高级照护表不会自动变成PCP授权。

00:07:35.232 --> 00:07:50.952
The school assigns six adult profiles: morphine, methoxyflurane, acetaminophen, ketorolac, dimenhydrinate and tranexamic acid. The next slides connect their mechanisms to the most important current safety distinctions.
学校指定六种成人专论：吗啡、甲氧氟烷、对乙酰氨基酚、酮咯酸、茶苯海明和氨甲环酸。下列把机制联系最重要现行安全区别。

00:07:50.952 --> 00:08:04.080
The linked sources retain the full current reference. Classroom examples and mathematical exercises below never substitute for the complete current clinical screening or an individual authorization check.
所链来源保留完整现行参考。下面课堂及计算练习永远不替代完整当前临床筛查和个人权限核查。

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:19.416
Morphine reduces pain through opioid action but can depress breathing and circulation. The current BCEHS PCP listing is not general permission for acute-trauma IV morphine; it distinguishes palliative and interfacility contexts.
吗啡经阿片作用减痛，也会抑制呼吸循环。当前BCEHS的PCP条目不是急性创伤静脉吗啡普遍权限，而区分姑息及院间情境。

00:08:19.416 --> 00:08:36.624
The palliative plan requires prior CliniCall or palliative-team discussion. Its listed adult subcutaneous range is two point five to five milligrams every ten to thirty minutes, with pressure and plan conditions and a maximum twenty milligrams per hour.
姑息计划需先与CliniCall或姑息团队讨论。所列成人皮下范围2.5至5毫克、每10至30分钟，需满足血压及计划条件，每小时最多20毫克。

00:08:36.624 --> 00:08:57.720
Interfacility direct dosing has a different maximum and requires CCP A consultation. Do not carry one context's route or maximum into another. Read contraindications including respiratory depression, hypotension, hypersensitivity and head injury with reduced consciousness, plus the MAO-inhibitor restriction.
院间直接给药有不同上限且需CCP-A会诊。不能把一种情境的途径上限搬到另一种。应读呼吸抑制、低血压、过敏、头伤伴意识下降等禁忌，以及单胺氧化酶抑制剂限制。

00:08:57.720 --> 00:09:13.536
Monitor pain, respiratory depth and rate, airway protection, awareness and pressure. Other depressants increase risk. The school dilution math can be practised without implying that a student may give the resulting syringe.
监测痛、呼吸深度频率、气道保护、意识和血压。合并其他抑制物会增险。可以练学校稀释计算，却不代表学生能给这支注射器。

00:09:13.536 --> 00:09:29.736
Methoxyflurane is a volatile inhaled analgesic with incompletely defined molecular action. The patient must understand, cooperate and self-administer under direct supervision; altered awareness or instability changes suitability.
甲氧氟烷为分子机制未完全明确的挥发吸入镇痛药。患者须理解、合作，并在直接监督下自行吸用；意识变化或不稳定会改变适合度。

00:09:29.736 --> 00:09:43.680
Current adult dosing is three millilitres, with a possible repeat after twenty minutes and a six-millilitre total. Patient limits also include six millilitres in twenty-four hours and fifteen in a week.
当前成人3毫升，可在20分钟后按需重复，总量6毫升；患者还有限制：24小时6毫升，一周15毫升。

00:09:43.680 --> 00:10:04.584
Screen the full exclusions, including under eighteen, pregnancy or breastfeeding, impaired cooperation or consciousness, renal impairment, relevant anesthetic-related liver history, tetracyclines, malignant-hyperthermia history and muscular dystrophy. Monitor awareness, breathing, pressure and symptoms.
完整筛查包括未满18、妊娠或哺乳、合作或意识不足、肾功能问题、相关麻醉药后肝损伤史、四环素、恶性高热史及肌营养不良等排除；监测意识、呼吸、血压和症状。

00:10:04.584 --> 00:10:19.656
Attach the carbon chamber and use ventilation precautions. Current provider exposure is at most three doses totaling nine millilitres per twenty-four hours, not the school's eighteen. Excess exposure can cause serious renal harm.
连接活性炭罐并采取通风措施。当前医护24小时最多暴露三剂、共9毫升，不是学校写的18。过量暴露可致严重肾损害。

00:10:19.656 --> 00:10:39.576
Acetaminophen provides analgesia and antipyresis. Screen hypersensitivity, severe hepatic disease, suspected overdose, last dose and all-source cumulative intake. Current adult oral dosing is five hundred to one thousand milligrams, repeatable once after four hours.
对乙酰氨基酚镇痛退热。筛查过敏、严重肝病、疑似过量、末剂及所有来源累计量。当前成人口服500至1000毫克，可4小时后再重复一次。

00:10:39.576 --> 00:10:54.816
The usual all-source daily maximum is four grams; specified liver dysfunction or malnutrition reduces it to two grams. Combination products count. A mathematical remaining allowance does not override a contraindication.
通常所有来源日上限4克；规定肝功能问题或营养不良降为2克。复方制剂也算。算出还有余量不能推翻禁忌。

00:10:54.816 --> 00:11:13.704
PCP intravenous use is not a universal fifteen-milligram-per-kilogram order. The adult table permits one gram for fifty kilograms or more; the adolescent table has its own age and weight wording. Under-fifty-kilogram IV dosing is not authorized for PCP in that table.
PCP静脉不是普遍每公斤15毫克。成人表对至少50公斤列1克；青少年表另有年龄体重措辞。该表中低于50公斤静脉剂量不授权PCP。

00:11:13.704 --> 00:11:31.584
Eligible one-gram IV doses infuse over fifteen minutes. Monitor for hypotension; the current monograph states baseline pressure then every fifteen minutes three times, unlike the school's five-minute summary. Deterioration demands immediate reassessment.
符合条件的1克静脉用15分钟输注。监测低血压；现行专论为基线后每15分钟三次，不同于学校每5分钟概括。恶化须立即复评。

00:11:31.584 --> 00:11:47.424
Ketorolac inhibits COX pathways and can reduce pain, but may cause renal, gastrointestinal and bleeding harm. Current adult PCP dosing is ten milligrams IV or IM, repeatable after six hours if indicated.
酮咯酸抑制COX通路并减痛，也可能伤肾、胃肠或出血。当前成人PCP为静脉或肌肉10毫克，有适应证可6小时后重复。

00:11:47.424 --> 00:11:59.520
The IV dose is undiluted over at least fifteen seconds; the IM dose is direct injection. The school's thirty-milligram adult summary is not the current BCEHS starting dose.
静脉剂量不稀释，至少15秒给完；肌注为直接注射。学校成人30毫克概括不是当前BCEHS起始剂量。

00:11:59.520 --> 00:12:18.216
Current contraindications include relevant hypersensitivity, known or suspected renal dysfunction, concern for severe active bleeding, pregnancy and anticoagulant use. Severe depletion and recent NSAID use are listed cautions, not silently renamed absolute exclusions.
现行禁忌包括相关过敏、已知或疑似肾功能问题、担心严重活动出血、妊娠及使用抗凝药。严重失液及近期NSAID列为慎用，不能暗改成绝对禁忌。

00:12:18.216 --> 00:12:35.304
For ages two to eleven, the PCP table gives zero point five milligrams per kilogram IM with a ten-milligram maximum, not the school's fifteen. The ACP table includes IV; that does not grant the same pediatric route to PCP.
2至11岁PCP表为肌注每公斤0.5毫克、最多10毫克，不是学校15。ACP表包括静脉，不等于PCP也获同儿科途径。

00:12:35.304 --> 00:12:51.288
Dimenhydrinate has H one and anticholinergic effects. Current nausea indications, frail-patient dosing and age or license headings must be checked; the school's general antiemetic description is not a dose order for everyone.
茶苯海明有H1及抗胆碱作用。应查当前恶心适应证、衰弱剂量及年龄执照标题；学校概括止吐不等于所有人同一剂量医嘱。

00:12:51.288 --> 00:13:05.304
For the school preparation example, one millilitre containing fifty milligrams plus nine millilitres diluent makes ten millilitres at five milligrams per millilitre. It does not mean the whole syringe must be administered.
学校配制例子中，1毫升含50毫克，加9毫升稀释液，得10毫升、每毫升5毫克；不代表必须给整支。

00:13:05.304 --> 00:13:21.432
At that concentration, a twelve-point-five-milligram amount occupies two point five millilitres. The amount must first be indicated and authorized. Use the current slow-administration guidance rather than equating syringe size with dose.
该浓度下12.5毫克占2.5毫升。但药量须先有适应证并获授权。按当前慢给指导，不能把注射器大小当剂量。

00:13:21.432 --> 00:13:35.592
Watch for drowsiness, dry mouth, urinary retention, tachycardia and local irritation, as well as nausea response. New decreased awareness can interfere with airway protection and safe assessment.
看困倦、口干、尿潴留、心动过速、局部刺激及恶心反应。新意识下降会妨碍气道保护和安全评估。

00:13:35.592 --> 00:13:49.488
Tranexamic acid limits fibrinolysis; it does not replace mechanical bleeding control or directly create a new clot. Eligibility depends on the actual hemorrhage context, timing and exclusions.
氨甲环酸限制纤溶，不代替机械止血，也不直接新造血块。资格依真实出血背景、时机和排除条件。

00:13:49.488 --> 00:14:03.048
The saved school adult monograph says one gram over ten minutes, while its integrated case says two grams over one minute. Those are conflicting regimens, not two descriptions of the same preparation.
学校存档成人专论写1克10分钟，综合案例却写2克1分钟。这是不同且冲突方案，不是同一配制的两种说法。

00:14:03.048 --> 00:14:18.576
The checked current BCEHS adult regimen is two grams IV over one minute for eligible patients. Apply the complete current eligibility and exclusion screen and the injury-time restriction; maternal hemorrhage has a consultation requirement.
已核当前BCEHS成人方案为符合患者静脉2克、1分钟给完。须使用完整当前适应及排除筛查和伤后时间限制；产科出血另有会诊要求。

00:14:18.576 --> 00:14:34.560
For a calculation using one hundred milligrams per millilitre, two thousand milligrams requires twenty millilitres. That calculation does not authorize IM, SC or another route, and does not settle an unconfirmed school exam version.
计算若浓度每毫升100毫克，2000毫克需20毫升。算式不授权肌肉、皮下或其他途径，也不能替代尚未确认学校考试版本。

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:46.752
Pediatric handling differs with development, body composition, organ maturity and illness. A small adult calculation is not enough to establish safe pediatric treatment.
儿科药物处理随发育、身体组成、器官成熟和疾病不同。缩小成人计算不足以证明儿科安全。

00:14:46.752 --> 00:14:58.512
First verify that this drug and route are authorized at this age and in this clinical setting. A perfect weight-based calculation cannot overcome a prohibited route or patient age.
先核实此年龄及临床环境允许该药和途径。再完美的按体重计算也不能推翻途径或年龄禁止。

00:14:58.512 --> 00:15:08.520
Calculate the amount from the approved weight basis, apply the dose and cumulative limits, then calculate a measurable volume using the actual concentration.
按批准体重基础算药量，应用单剂及累计上限，再用真实浓度算能测量的体积。

00:15:08.520 --> 00:15:22.992
Include a developmentally appropriate explanation, caregiver information and baseline physiological assessment. A frightened child needs calm care, but distress must not obscure respiratory or circulatory failure.
加入适合发育的解释、照护者信息及生理基线。害怕的孩子需要平静照护，但不能让紧张掩盖呼吸循环衰竭。

00:15:22.992 --> 00:15:32.784
Establish the dosing weight in kilograms and document whether it was measured, reported or estimated. Do not make an estimate look like a scale measurement.
建立以公斤表示的给药体重，并记实测、转述或估计。不能把估计写成秤量。

00:15:32.784 --> 00:15:46.512
The school emphasizes actual weight or a Broselow-type length tool. Use the current approved tool within its size range and instructions; a colour band is an estimate, not universally exact actual weight.
学校强调实测或Broselow类身长工具。应在当前批准工具范围和说明内使用；颜色带是估计，不是所有人都精确等于真实体重。

00:15:46.512 --> 00:16:00.192
A reported forty-four pounds is about twenty kilograms, not forty-four kilograms. Keep conversion visible and check whether a drug needs a particular weight basis rather than assuming one basis fits every drug.
报告44磅约20公斤，不是44公斤。保留换算，并查药物是否需特定体重基础，不能假定所有药同一种。

00:16:00.192 --> 00:16:10.152
The checker should verify both the weight input and the computation. Two people multiplying the same wrong unlabelled number do not prevent a unit error.
核查者应同时核实体重输入和运算。两个人用同一个无单位错数相乘，不能防单位错误。

00:16:10.152 --> 00:16:21.744
Use a fictional training order of zero point zero eight milligrams per kilogram for an eighteen-kilogram patient. The kilogram units cancel, giving one point four four milligrams.
用虚构训练医嘱每公斤0.08毫克、患者18公斤。公斤单位约去，得1.44毫克。

00:16:21.744 --> 00:16:34.128
With a product of two milligrams per millilitre, divide one point four four milligrams by two milligrams per millilitre. Milligrams cancel and the result is zero point seven two millilitres.
制剂每毫升2毫克，用1.44毫克除以每毫升2毫克，毫克约去，得0.72毫升。

00:16:34.128 --> 00:16:45.360
Now check whether the single and cumulative maximum, route, concentration and measurement precision all allow that result. The arithmetic is only one part of the decision.
再查单剂和累计上限、途径、浓度及测量精度是否容许结果。算术只是决策一部分。

00:16:45.360 --> 00:16:59.544
Reverse-check: zero point seven two millilitres times two milligrams per millilitre equals one point four four milligrams. A second calculation from original inputs should independently reach the same result.
反算：0.72毫升乘每毫升2毫克，得1.44毫克。另一核查者应从原输入独立算出同结果。

00:16:59.544 --> 00:17:11.616
A fictional protocol says zero point five milligrams per kilogram, maximum ten milligrams. For twenty-eight kilograms the uncapped calculation is fourteen milligrams.
虚构流程每公斤0.5毫克、最多10毫克。28公斤未封顶计算为14毫克。

00:17:11.616 --> 00:17:24.192
Apply the cap before calculating volume: the allowed amount is ten milligrams if all other criteria are satisfied. At five milligrams per millilitre that occupies two millilitres.
先应用上限再算体积；其他条件都满足时药量10毫克。每毫升5毫克时体积2毫升。

00:17:24.192 --> 00:17:35.784
A maximum is not a target that every smaller patient should receive. A repeat dose must also respect the cumulative limit and timing, not merely another single-dose cap.
上限不是所有较小患者都该达到的目标。重复剂还要符合累计限制和时间，不能只再套一个单剂上限。

00:17:35.784 --> 00:17:49.440
Do not automatically carry the school's pediatric six-hundred-fifty-milligram acetaminophen cap into current BCEHS care; its current oral cumulative and IV eligibility rules differ. Identify the source version.
不能自动把学校儿科对乙酰氨基酚650毫克上限搬到当前BCEHS；现行口服累计及静脉资格规则不同，应标明来源版本。

00:17:49.440 --> 00:18:03.168
The school morphine example starts with ten milligrams in one millilitre and adds nine millilitres of compatible diluent. The drug amount stays ten milligrams while the final volume becomes ten millilitres.
学校吗啡例子从1毫升10毫克开始，加9毫升相容稀释液。药量仍10毫克，最终体积变10毫升。

00:18:03.168 --> 00:18:14.280
Ten milligrams divided by ten millilitres is one milligram per millilitre. Adding ten millilitres instead would produce eleven millilitres and a different concentration.
10毫克除10毫升，为每毫升1毫克。若误加10毫升，就成11毫升、浓度不同。

00:18:14.280 --> 00:18:27.984
For the school fictional twenty-five-kilogram dose calculation at zero point zero five milligrams per kilogram, the amount is one point two five milligrams and the prepared volume is one point two five millilitres.
学校25公斤、每公斤0.05毫克的计算示例，药量1.25毫克，按配好浓度体积1.25毫升。

00:18:27.984 --> 00:18:42.384
This is a calculation demonstration, not a PCP pediatric morphine order. Label the final concentration, use appropriate measuring equipment and verify the actual authority before any real administration.
这是计算示范，不是PCP儿科吗啡医嘱。标最终浓度，用适当量具，并在任何真实给药前核实权限。

00:18:42.384 --> 00:18:55.248
The school says never round up pediatric doses. Preserve that warning against casual upward rounding, but recognize that a mathematical answer may have more decimals than a syringe can measure.
学校说儿科绝不向上取整，应保留反对随意上取整的警告；但数学答案可能比注射器刻度的小数位多。

00:18:55.248 --> 00:19:07.680
Keep adequate precision during calculations, then use an approved final-dose or volume-rounding policy and equipment. Do not pretend a tiny unmeasurable volume was delivered exactly.
计算中保留足够精度，最后按批准剂量或体积取整政策及器具；不能假装极小不可测量体积已精确送入。

00:19:07.680 --> 00:19:21.960
A standardized compatible dilution may allow safer measurement, but only if the actual drug, stability, route and preparation procedure support it. Dilution does not automatically make a wrong drug safe.
标准相容稀释可使测量更安全，但要真实药物、稳定性、途径及配制规程支持。稀释不会自动把错药变安全。

00:19:21.960 --> 00:19:35.496
Use a leading zero for less than one unit and avoid an unnecessary trailing zero: zero point five, not point five or five point zero when five is intended. Say the unit every time.
小于一单位写前导零，不用多余尾零：0.5，不写.5；要5就不写5.0。每次说出单位。

00:19:35.496 --> 00:19:50.688
The school calculates a twenty-millilitre-per-kilogram bolus. For thirty-two kilograms, the arithmetic is six hundred forty millilitres. That correct multiplication does not prove the whole volume should be given rapidly.
学校计算每公斤20毫升快速补液，32公斤算640毫升。乘法正确不证明整量应快速给。

00:19:50.688 --> 00:20:04.368
The checked D zero three pediatric guidance instead considers increments of five to ten millilitres per kilogram and a twenty-millilitre-per-kilogram limit. The cause of shock and treatment response still determine the plan.
已核D03儿科指导考虑每公斤5至10毫升分次，并有每公斤20毫升限制。休克原因和治疗反应仍决定计划。

00:20:04.368 --> 00:20:19.344
BCEHS PCPs may not initiate cannulation under twelve. A fluid calculation for a younger child is therefore not permission to establish IV or IO access. Use the authorized care and appropriate support.
BCEHS PCP不能给未满12岁建立穿刺通路。为更小儿童算液体，不代表可建立静脉或骨内，应提供获授权照护及适当支援。

00:20:19.344 --> 00:20:34.752
After an authorized increment, compare perfusion, pulse, mental state, pressure and breathing. New crackles or worsening effort may signal harm. Do not give repeated fluid simply to normalize every pressure number.
每次获授权分次后比较灌注、脉搏、意识、血压和呼吸。新湿啰音或用力加重可能提示伤害，不能只为使每个血压正常就重复补液。

00:20:34.752 --> 00:20:46.608
The regulation distinguishes category services from services requiring an endorsement. A possible Schedule Two service is not proof that every PCP currently holds that endorsement.
法规区分类别服务与需签注服务。附表二可能列某项，不证明每名PCP当前都持该签注。

00:20:46.608 --> 00:21:01.752
The practitioner must also meet individual restrictions, training and competence requirements, and the employer must operationalize the intervention. An employer guideline cannot by itself create a legal permission that does not otherwise exist.
个人还须符合限制、训练和能力要求，雇主也须实施该干预。雇主指南本身不能凭空创造原本不存在法定权限。

00:21:01.752 --> 00:21:16.728
The school says employers may expand scope. Read that as implementation within valid legal authority, not permission to exceed the law. Medical consultation also does not automatically remove a legal restriction.
学校说雇主可扩大范围，应理解为有效法律权限内实施，不是允许超越法律。医疗会诊也不会自动取消法定限制。

00:21:16.728 --> 00:21:29.232
Finally, a permitted intervention still needs an appropriate patient indication, valid consent or other authority and an acceptable risk-benefit judgment. May do does not mean must do.
最后，即使允许干预，也仍需适当患者适应证、有效同意或其他权限，以及可接受风险收益。能做不等于必须做。

00:21:29.232 --> 00:21:44.376
The school calls tracheal intubation standard for PCPs in one passage. The Board's January twenty twenty-five statement says recognized PCP programs do not include it and BCEHS does not operationalize it at PCP level.
学校某处称气管插管为PCP标准项目。监管委员会2025年1月声明说认可PCP课程不包括该项，BCEHS也未在PCP等级实施。

00:21:44.376 --> 00:21:56.760
A listed possible endorsement and an actual recognized pathway are different. Do not infer that passing an entry-level exam grants the intervention or the sedation medications needed for it.
可能列出的签注与真实认可训练路径不同。不能推断通过入门考试就得到该操作或所需镇静药权限。

00:21:56.760 --> 00:22:11.400
For ipratropium, the current public monograph names PCP severe bronchospasm and pediatric consultation. It does not independently verify the school's universal claim about an ePCR-profile endorsement display.
异丙托溴铵现行公开专论列PCP严重痉挛及儿科会诊，但并未独立证明学校关于ePCR个人档案签注显示的普遍说法。

00:22:11.400 --> 00:22:23.784
Verify the actual licence, required education and employer status rather than inventing their contents. Keep a school claim marked unconfirmed if the complete policy is not accessible.
应核实真实执照、所需教育和雇主状态，不能编造其内容。完整政策无法取得时，应把学校说法保留为未确认。

00:22:23.784 --> 00:22:39.720
Current PCP intranasal ketamine requires the specified flight-training and endorsement pathway plus prior consultation. The monograph excludes age under five, rather than merely requiring a consult below two as the school matrix says.
当前PCP鼻内氯胺酮需指定飞行训练及签注路径，并事先会诊。专论排除未满5岁，不是学校矩阵所说仅未满2岁需会诊。

00:22:39.720 --> 00:22:52.608
Current glucagon listings include FR and EMR hypoglycemia contexts with age conditions. That clinical listing still does not prove an individual has completed required training or endorsements.
当前胰高血糖素条目包括有年龄条件的FR及EMR低血糖情境，但临床条目仍不能证明个人已完成所需训练或签注。

00:22:52.608 --> 00:23:05.592
Hydromorphone PCP use is linked to palliative or end-of-life pain and a prior CliniCall or palliative-team dosing plan. Do not convert this into general permission for acute-trauma opioid treatment.
氢吗啡酮PCP用途联系姑息或临终疼痛，并需事先CliniCall或姑息团队剂量计划，不能变成普遍急性创伤阿片权限。

00:23:05.592 --> 00:23:22.152
The school describes a licensing-exam nitroglycerin update. The checked current BCEHS EMR and PCP monograph still lists heart rate below fifty or above one hundred fifty. Distinguish the versions and verify every other contraindication too.
学校描述硝酸甘油执照考试更新；已核当前BCEHS EMR及PCP专论仍列心率低于50或高于150。要区分版本，也核实所有其他禁忌。

00:23:22.152 --> 00:23:35.880
The school abbreviates PCP IO to a tibial site, two attempts and hypovolemic arrest. Current PR twelve also specifies training and the age-twelve-or-older condition for the independent pathway.
学校把PCP骨内简为胫骨、两次尝试及低容量骤停。当前PR12还规定训练，以及独立路径至少12岁的条件。

00:23:35.880 --> 00:23:48.096
The reference includes an on-scene ACP-or-higher supervision alternative. Do not omit that alternative, but do not use it to erase the stated prohibition on PCP cannulation under twelve.
参考包括现场ACP或以上直接监督的替代路径，不能漏掉；但也不能用它抹掉PCP未满12岁穿刺禁止。

00:23:48.096 --> 00:23:59.688
The tibia is the approved PCP site, and attempts are two collectively per patient, not two per limb or per provider. Do not recannulate a failed or dislodged site.
PCP获准部位为胫骨；每患者总共两次，不是每肢或每人两次。不能在失败或脱出部位重新穿刺。

00:23:59.688 --> 00:24:12.408
IO attempts must not detract from effective CPR, airway management or defibrillation. These scope distinctions are preparation for supervised skills, not a claim of competence from watching slides.
骨内尝试不能妨碍有效CPR、气道管理或除颤。这些权限区别为督导技能准备，不代表看完幻灯就合格。

00:24:12.408 --> 00:24:28.440
A fifty-six-year-old worker is injured by a moving industrial panel. There is major forearm bleeding, pallor and confusion. The equipment has not yet been isolated. This is an original teaching case, not the school's assessed case.
56岁工人被移动工业板件伤到，前臂大量出血、苍白、混乱，设备尚未隔离。这是原创教学案例，不是学校考核案例。

00:24:28.440 --> 00:24:40.800
Observe the mechanical hazard and arrange safe access before contact. Delegate bleeding control with the indicated trained method while the team assesses airway, breathing and perfusion.
接触前观察机械危险并安排安全通路。分派用有适应证且受训方法止血，团队同时评估气道、呼吸及灌注。

00:24:40.800 --> 00:24:53.112
Prevent heat loss, arrange urgent appropriate transport and request additional help. Do not delay these actions while one person reads every drug card or attempts an unnecessary line.
防失温、安排紧急适当转运并求援。不能为了一个人读完所有药卡或尝试不必要通路而延误。

00:24:53.112 --> 00:25:07.992
A medication plan now needs actual vital signs, injury timing, contraindications and individual authority. Pain does not automatically make morphine appropriate, and giving TXA does not prove bleeding is controlled.
此时药物计划需真实生命体征、受伤时间、禁忌及个人权限。痛不自动使吗啡适合，给了TXA也不证明已止血。

00:25:07.992 --> 00:25:22.608
Assume the instructor confirms adult TXA eligibility and the current two-gram IV plan for this practice. The product is one hundred milligrams per millilitre. State two grams equals two thousand milligrams.
假设教员为练习确认成人TXA资格及当前静脉2克计划，制剂每毫升100毫克。先说2克等于2000毫克。

00:25:22.608 --> 00:25:36.720
Divide two thousand milligrams by one hundred milligrams per millilitre to get twenty millilitres. An independent checker verifies the patient, regimen, container and calculation before the preparation is connected.
2000毫克除每毫升100毫克得20毫升。独立核查者在配制连接前核患者、方案、容器及计算。

00:25:36.720 --> 00:25:51.480
The school also practises five-hundred-millilitre adult fluid increments and a limited-pressure trauma strategy. Do not turn that into a universal target: head, spinal and other shock contexts may require different plans.
学校也练成人500毫升分次补液及限制血压创伤策略。不能变成普遍目标；头伤、脊髓及其他休克背景可能需不同计划。

00:25:51.480 --> 00:26:03.984
State the treatment goal and reassess after each authorized increment. A palpable radial pulse is not a measured pressure and does not by itself prove adequate organ perfusion.
说出治疗目标，每次获授权分次后复评。能触及桡动脉不是实测血压，也不能单独证明器官灌注充分。

00:26:03.984 --> 00:26:17.040
During movement the patient becomes quieter, breaths become shallower and pressure falls. Stop treating the first written plan as fixed. Return to immediate assessment and support failed functions.
搬动中患者更安静、呼吸更浅、血压下降。不能把第一书面计划当固定，回即时评估并支持失败功能。

00:26:17.040 --> 00:26:28.608
Recheck hemorrhage control and the vascular site, look for hidden injury and confirm what medications and volumes were actually administered. One deterioration can have more than one cause.
重查止血及血管部位、找隐匿伤，并确认实际给了哪些药及体积。一次恶化可能有多个原因。

00:26:28.608 --> 00:26:43.224
If a sedating medicine was given, assess its contribution without assuming it explains every finding. A new rash with airway or circulatory compromise needs the relevant reaction pathway, not just a label of side effect.
若给过镇静药，要评估其参与，但不能假定解释所有发现。新皮疹伴气道或循环受损需相应反应路径，不能只贴副作用标签。

00:26:43.224 --> 00:26:55.536
Communicate the change, request appropriate help and revise the transport and treatment plan. Record before-and-after data so the receiving clinician can follow what changed and when.
沟通变化、请求适当支援并修改转运治疗计划。记录前后数据，让接诊者能追踪何时发生什么变化。

00:26:55.536 --> 00:27:07.368
Transfer the indication and relevant allergy or risk information, then every actual dose and its time. Saying that pain medicine was given is not enough to prevent duplication.
交接适应证及相关过敏风险，再交每次实际剂量和时间。只说给了止痛药，不足防重复。

00:27:07.368 --> 00:27:19.488
Use both drug amount and relevant concentration or volume when needed for verification, with units. Clearly identify an infusion that is still running and its rate and remaining contents.
核实时按需同时给药量及浓度或体积，带单位。明确仍在运行输注、速度及剩余内容。

00:27:19.488 --> 00:27:32.136
State the response with measured times, including any adverse effect and action taken. An uncompleted medication or prepared-but-not-given syringe must not be reported as administered.
用带测量时间反应交接，包括不良作用及处理。未完成给药或配好未给注射器，不能报为已给。

00:27:32.136 --> 00:27:45.864
The receiving clinician needs cumulative intake, last dose, unresolved symptoms and the next restriction, not just a reassuring final snapshot. Confirm that responsibility has actually transferred.
接手者需要累计摄入、末剂、未解决症状和下一限制，不只是最后好看的一张快照。确认责任真的已转交。

00:27:45.864 --> 00:27:58.464
Without notes, explain why dose accuracy, clinical suitability and authorization are three different requirements. Give an example in which the arithmetic is right but the treatment is not permitted.
不看笔记解释剂量准确、临床适合、授权为何是三个不同要求，并举算对却不允许治疗的例子。

00:27:58.464 --> 00:28:09.336
Complete the original calculation exercises and reverse-check the units. Identify which school dose statements conflict internally or with the checked current service source.
完成原创计算练习并反核单位，指出哪些学校剂量说法内部冲突或与已核当前机构来源不一致。

00:28:09.336 --> 00:28:24.000
In a supervised rehearsal, speak the medication check, label the preparation and ask the checker to use original inputs. Then say the expected effect, adverse warnings and reassessment plan before giving anything.
督导演练时口述药物核查、标记配制，并要求核查者使用原输入。任何给药前，说预期作用、不良警讯和复评计划。

00:28:24.000 --> 00:28:35.880
The reading view provides the calculation chain, discrepancy ledger and an original blank safety worksheet. It is not a school assessment answer or the official medication-competency sign-off.
阅读视图提供计算链、差异表及原创空白安全工作表，不是学校考核答案，也不是官方药物能力签核。
